OL,3,GNEWSAHotel owner ran up #160k water
OL,4,Abill debt, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA businessman ran up a debt of #160,000
OL,7,Fin water bills at three hotels over a
OL,8,Fperiod of nearly nine years, a court
OL,9,Fhas heard.
OL,11,FSheikh Abid Gulzar is accused of 10
OL,12,Fcounts of fraud, alongside co-defendant
OL,13,FManasdeep Singh, which both deny.
OL,15,FAt the opening of a trial at Lewes
OL,16,FCrown Court earlier, the jury heard
OL,17,FGulzar, 81, had only made one payment
OL,18,Fof #176 for water since 2018.
OL,20,FHe denies fraudulently using shell
OL,21,Fcompanies to avoid paying for water.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
